        	<li><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif">&nbsp;<span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Subject to subsection (A) of this section, the Mayor may adjust the actual amount in an imprest fund from time to time.</span></span></span></li>
