        <p>&nbsp;</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, April 20, 2026</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, May 27, 2026</p><p>ORD C36855 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=07.03.030">Section 07.03.030</a> REPEALED (Building Services and Code Enforcement Department)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C34134.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 26, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, January 2, 2008</p><p>ORD C34134 Section 1</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=07.03.040">Section 07.03.040</a> Rules and Regulations<br />
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>
        
        <ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The Director of Accounting establishes in writing rules and regulations regarding disbursement, replenishment, accounting<u>,</u> and use of imprest funds.</span></span></span></span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol start="2" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background-color:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The Director of Accounting authorizes travel advances and adopts the rules and regulations for authorization, documentation, accounting<u>,</u> and recovery of unspent advances, in accordance with state statutes and regulations.</span></span></span></span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <p style="margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in; text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>
        
